  "releaseNotes": "IntentSharp 1.1.0: a fifth package, IntentSharp.Specialist, for models defined per intent, and additions to the four existing packages. Nothing is removed or changed in meaning, so an application on 1.0.x upgrades without code changes. Release notes: https://intentsharp.com/changelog",
